            "logprobs": [],
            "text": "**ISPH is The International School @ ParkCity Hanoi.** It accepts applications throughout the year, subject to places being available. Its published fee schedule is for **2026–2027**. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/admissions/admissions-guide/?utm_source=openai))\n\n## Admission process\n\n1. **Apply online:** Complete the school’s OpenApply application, upload the required supporting documents, and accept the enrolment terms.\n2. **Attend an assessment:** You and your child meet the Principal, Head of Primary, or Head of Secondary; your child completes assessment tasks.\n3. **Receive a decision:** Successful applicants normally receive an offer letter within two days, subject to availability.\n4. **Accept the place:** Sign and return the offer letter and pay the registration fee.\n5. **Complete enrolment:** Pay the applicable tuition, deposit, and any other required fees before your child starts. Contact admissions first to check availability in the relevant year group. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/admissions/admissions-guide/?utm_source=openai))\n\n## Tuition fees: 2026–2027\n\nAll figures below are in **Vietnamese dong (VND)**. The termly column is the **total for the whole year**, not the price per term. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/School-Fee-2026-2027-V.pdf))\n\n| Year group | Annual-payment option | Total if paid termly |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Nursery and Reception | 211,565,750 | 232,714,000 |\n| Year 1 | 327,987,000 | 360,815,000 |\n| Years 2–4 | 580,582,000 | 638,790,000 |\n| Years 5–6 | 589,570,000 | 648,740,000 |\n| Years 7–9 | 652,379,000 | 717,650,000 |\n| Years 10–13 | 691,541,000 | 760,770,000 |\n\nThe termly plan splits payments **40% / 30% / 30%**. Nursery, Reception, and Year 1 figures already include promotional reductions. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/School-Fee-2026-2027-V.pdf))\n\n### Additional fees and discounts\n\n- **Application:** VND 3,700,000 listed.\n- **Registration:** VND 18,650,000 for Nursery/Reception; VND 37,300,000 for Years 1–13, non-refundable.\n- **Security deposit:** VND 35,000,000, refundable subject to at least one full academic term’s written withdrawal notice.\n- **Sibling tuition discounts:** 5% for the second child; 10% for the third and subsequent children. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/School-Fee-2026-2027-V.pdf))\n\n**Check the application charge before paying:** the admissions FAQ currently says it is waived for new applicants, despite the standard fee being listed in the schedule. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/admissions/faqs/?utm_source=openai))\n\nFor a midyear start, request a personalised quotation and confirmation of annual-payment eligibility, other charges, and available incentives.\n\n**School contact:** info@isph.edu.vn · **+84 2 456 789 000**. ([isph.edu.vn](https://isph.edu.vn/admissions/fee-and-incentive/))\n\nIf you share your child’s age and intended start date, I can help identify the relevant fee band."
